m]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]`sase bead search -e/--regex <pattern>` matches beads with a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]regular expression on both the Rust fast path and the Python [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]fallback, while the default literal search keeps its current [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]substring semantics and compiles no regex at all.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bead_search_regex.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/bead_search_regex.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-i1[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-i1/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust core regex matcher and fast-path flag[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: add a shared bead query matcher to sase-core, thread an opt-in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`regex` argument through `search_issues`/`search_issues_in_issues` and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the `bead_search` PyO3 binding, teach the Rust bead CLI to parse [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`-e`/`--regex` and to highlight and snippet regex matches, and cover all[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]of it with Rust tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Adopt the released core in the sase dependency floor[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]floor[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]floor: after sase-core publishes the release that carries the regex [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]binding, raise the `sase-core-rs` minimum in pyproject.toml, refresh [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]uv.lock, and confirm the published-core minimum smoke tooling accepts [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the new floor.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Python CLI flag, rendering, tests, and docs[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after floor[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: add the `-e`/`--regex` option to the `sase bead search` argparse [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]parser, plumb it through the bead read facade and BeadProject, handle [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]invalid patterns and regex snippet selection in the Python renderer, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]update the bead search tests and documentation.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-i1","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-i1.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-d65f3aca26724eea3da66d2cabeecdf1","started_at":"2026-08-09T11:42:58.634902+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"0cfd1a3c6748e4fd2408346f9d7782b0afe0caa94614517f70ef45bc220c9a74","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-i1.2/chat.md","size_bytes":4148},"commits":{"digest":"e45ade560929351feecd8199fb9e8689168d52c7c9ac7cf3fb317ab894a809a3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-i1.2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-i1.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"70ddec450b6845646452ec3f05efb1fcba1767d1cfba268f3d6be429d419cff5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-i1.2/meta.json","size_bytes":633},"prompt":{"digest":"f7115cbcfe10a55ea1d937ab18d21b574b99915ede036d5a9bb3caf36900c3a8","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-i1.2/prompt.md","size_bytes":153